        },
        {
          "id": "dqm-slide-2",
          "title": "`xaggee` asks where",
          "description": "Use `xaggee` for where-questions with places and directions.",
          "focusPoints": [
            "`Xaggee baad tagaysaa?` is useful for errands",
            "`ku taal` asks where a place is located",
            "Reuse place words like `boosta` and `suuqa`"
